## 19. Important Disclaimer

GoldTrack is an educational API integration project.

The displayed gold prices are indicative spot-price estimates and may differ from local jewellery market prices.

Local taxes, dealer premiums, making charges and other fees are not included.

Currency exchange rates are reference rates and may differ from rates offered by financial institutions.

Always verify information with the original providers before making financial decisions.

